{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_029ass_02_1_2_029_02",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:0c33f7a726cb39a6bbaf40692c1fa0a3d36edb35e4cb3f3a551d319422ebb871",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_02_1_2_029_02:1_2_029_02_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:78b2ec04d3a8e07d704ffeda737bff94a6215c3062555e706e354e295feb9fde",
      "text": "极秘的圆桌会议",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_02_1_2_029_02:1_2_029_02_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:323396c32720c4e0c6a4e51f393f5121bffdea4047e80dd1be4262182de75d3b",
      "text": "阿斯兰的生日临近，Cafe Parade的\n大家开始策划惊喜派对。\n然而，由于背着他商量和准备的次数增加，\n导致阿斯兰产生了某种误会……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_02_1_2_029_02:1_2_029_02_a:cmd-000024:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2b09bcd6e18d66980a219b2c252065efab172f9d4ca056860b35d17112afe537",
      "text": "第2话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_02_1_2_029_02:1_2_029_02_a:cmd-000024:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:78b2ec04d3a8e07d704ffeda737bff94a6215c3062555e706e354e295feb9fde",
      "text": "极秘的圆桌会议",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_02_1_2_029_02:1_2_029_02_a:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:47409f09405ad8e91bf0199eb808024df0e960f4767ee5b6262241cd2c366c7b",
      "text": "那么就事不宜迟，来商量阿斯兰的\n惊喜生日派对吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_02_1_2_029_02:1_2_029_02_a:cmd-000060:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ffc31617ec8841e2012c7407662cf9c1f5e0e64529346898ab1d97c525a4be8f",
      "text": "好——！既然是阿斯兰的生日，\n料理果然还是做阿斯兰喜欢吃的东西最好呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_02_1_2_029_02:1_2_029_02_a:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1585e7564e5fc747c25444a74f9bef58d1f98e4a93e3697a1f1d1a55b8739fb4",
      "text": "蛋糕就交给我吧。\n大家还有什么主意吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_02_1_2_029_02:1_2_029_02_a:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:941397fc66c6ffba863f874aef52839397867e6d5530487c10c58257cb83479b",
      "text": "我想了很多点子！\n可以听听看吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_02_1_2_029_02:1_2_029_02_a:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f68ee84f1825ef195a03ca45631847e7d0bf9571f6f12db679ecd5049b17ff4b",
      "text": "当然可以。\n那么，我们一起来商量吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_02_1_2_029_02:1_2_029_02_a:cmd-000099:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6e59558c370c999e0b297f650cd82b0780280fd7b8d13edeb6209b6e673eb305",
      "text": "好的，务必！只要有庄一郎先生出手，\n一定会做出很棒的蛋糕的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_02_1_2_029_02:1_2_029_02_a:cmd-000116:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6854672a9e892a916a4227c37b61a15a69c84326710c20c8bbdd53fc477f8144",
      "text": "制作人，当天能拜托您\n负责拖住阿斯兰吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_02_1_2_029_02:1_2_029_02_a:cmd-000122:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:341fe7a4bff44cc98eacb0e06c4ef6fcd3cdf5f01ca8d66e31751bb595d7a301",
      "text": "派对会场的准备工作，这期间就包在我们身上，\n绝对办得妥妥当当的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_02_1_2_029_02:1_2_029_02_a:cmd-000128:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c4b055350dd73ea9944ed43233c48c7b15d3eb4cdfefad36b63674d9112b30e2",
      "text": "明白了！交给我吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_02_1_2_029_02:1_2_029_02_a:cmd-000134:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:01fd642c931e3adcd593e3d2118566d198d90f648918692f8e701b222a853862",
      "text": "这样商量起具体内容来，\n总觉得开始紧张起来了呢……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_02_1_2_029_02:1_2_029_02_a:cmd-000163:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:92a07f492ace0ffab7bb34e4e56026546e4267842924c8754ec2f8f8bda6f0a2",
      "text": "嗯嗯！为了让阿斯兰高兴，\n大家一起加油准备吧——！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_02_1_2_029_02:1_2_029_02_b:cmd-000026:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:48463b36e2734c9c53dcdcd7acb97e01bac095c311080e61a527ef3c8c1c874c",
      "text": "阿斯兰的卧室",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_02_1_2_029_02:1_2_029_02_b:cmd-000035:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f6c684b1e011100703b8c248d92fbca85aba61834cac7ee7b6168ec99b33163b",
      "text": "……此刻，究竟是……太阳似已高悬于天际，\n然而……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_02_1_2_029_02:1_2_029_02_b:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2aee1952fd1b02dda10ac8d5cecdd9930284490ac3a9bece3f4178fc9eeec194",
      "text": "（看来，是不慎陷入了沉眠……\n是因为昨夜在思考之海中徘徊的缘故么）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_02_1_2_029_02:1_2_029_02_b:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:75ac89df9fdd848bc982bdc771273e1da493a82291fd8160be6e368c83fa5137",
      "text": "撒旦啊。此等迷茫，究竟是吾之杞人忧天么。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_02_1_2_029_02:1_2_029_02_b:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e770002d8fc5ca410f66615da08594faf371f1fcba62f6fdcce57f65e2cc3d6c",
      "text": "（近日，暗之同胞团行动诡谲）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_02_1_2_029_02:1_2_029_02_b:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e01affec0b2e4154f69795a83bf150f63c7587fdc03b1360d92988e39a783457",
      "text": "（伴随吾之现身便草草结束交谈的，\n庄一郎与卷绪）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_02_1_2_029_02:1_2_029_02_b:cmd-000102:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:43bfbd1b3446d6fb1cfdadecfb7c9acf3bd9bad8eaab2f023dbd8ea16eb28036",
      "text": "（感知到吾之魔力后，便将刻有谜样纹样的书册\n藏起的咲，将念话机扣下的神谷）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_02_1_2_029_02:1_2_029_02_b:cmd-000117:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:56f2e3dfacd5a71530e5bb8f7bf3fa3515eff62ba2559fe1458d3a9a00944d73",
      "text": "（同胞们似乎皆隐匿着什么。\n不，抑或是……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_02_1_2_029_02:1_2_029_02_b:cmd-000125:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:395e1e0587dd4b9f9651c99d8688715f896c700b3636d0c7194d15a0e800904d",
      "text": "…………",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_02_1_2_029_02:1_2_029_02_b:cmd-000129:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cc9552c760f4a379fa3e26b0f93e3bf3a4528845e590b0b07e6ed937ddb68943",
      "text": "事已至此，唯有向主寻求指引了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_02_1_2_029_02:1_2_029_02_c:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fb61dfd7ef89fe11505320c696443d6dc08f709394e2babb35a94f7edafbf707",
      "text": "以上就是明天拍摄的流程。\n详情在这份资料里……阿斯兰先生？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_02_1_2_029_02:1_2_029_02_c:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:532ab5144e633ab2d2a402d57a781ba0febf7e697275c99d7d9017391b13ec91",
      "text": "……啊、啊啊。吾已知晓！于此番试炼中，\n吾亦将作为暗之眷属展现压倒性的魔力！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_02_1_2_029_02:1_2_029_02_c:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a751b4a324b917cf2e1c4cc539764e964a280fedd506ccfabcee7faaa4a9f049",
      "text": "您刚才好像在沉思什么。\n有不明白的地方，我可以再讲一遍哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_02_1_2_029_02:1_2_029_02_c:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f372697fedd23783d3d21ed910b0b2a37391e0e58f9241f1e42a5bb9ac2a04b5",
      "text": "否，主之计划天衣无缝。明日封印残影之事，\n断无问题。虽无问题……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_02_1_2_029_02:1_2_029_02_c:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:22994095793391d0004a20785103652283ea04afcce50657b763a15d498305f3",
      "text": "吾主。恕吾转变话题，\n吾是否做了何事，触怒了同胞们？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_02_1_2_029_02:1_2_029_02_c:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b713a7bfff253a21fc414886884acf06c659e1a434ce917f7d6acae5c7b6e689",
      "text": "对Cafe Parade的大家吗？\n这是怎么回事呢？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_02_1_2_029_02:1_2_029_02_c:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2278cbf7bcaed2f6d646a4fe0d051ffec6161f440cf9fe42e8e72a7ec4eab453",
      "text": "似是近来，同胞团皆在避开吾，\n召开极秘之圆桌会议。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_02_1_2_029_02:1_2_029_02_c:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9b5cee318cec7cf275f0bc56285cc9b1e5628c371fd95ee24171bf4761f91eb3",
      "text": "原来如此……那完全不用担心哦。\n我想很快就会真相大白的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_02_1_2_029_02:1_2_029_02_c:cmd-000049:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4bf8d5d8437b7d6cd495039f1eb0d3c98a58d199509cdb9acd58e87a577e8472",
      "text": "是如此么……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_02_1_2_029_02:1_2_029_02_c:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f95534edcbef2a51124240ee4db32696693a469a6b4be9b4a4d7dea836d201f4",
      "text": "吾知晓了。既然主如此断言，\n眼下便遵从该神谕吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_02_1_2_029_02:1_2_029_02_d:cmd-000028:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1d49b196ea13d8d7d5243f3e88926df0f0ea0bbbab708b2ccfb7c173f42e4aa3",
      "text": "生日派对当天……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_02_1_2_029_02:1_2_029_02_d:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:889b672727a1e6e50db3c86b9b219eb8228b3368da3e170d2d4d6de5b242f011",
      "text": "此番亦彰显了我等暗之同胞团之力。\n那么，吾便归去研习崭新之精炼术……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_02_1_2_029_02:1_2_029_02_d:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:51a42ea08b1a595cb3539e46e596d52bfe6ffb919bf88e8085e8c533d1b994fd",
      "text": "啊，请等一下！我还有关于下一份工作的事想和阿斯兰先生商量，\n能请您留下来吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_02_1_2_029_02:1_2_029_02_d:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f86a4f06fce3413a8133d8dc1c1bf5f03e114bf80483988bed43d6d65df52dc4",
      "text": "唔，寻吾么？看来又是向世人昭示撒旦之威光\n的良机降临了。吾愿闻其详！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_02_1_2_029_02:1_2_029_02_d:cmd-000110:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2cf299b9db82240fc03c5e3aeca137dae387b6b9aadfc396c17215c632e680b3",
      "text": "数十分钟后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_02_1_2_029_02:1_2_029_02_d:cmd-000120:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:697dc0925f92b3cbe9db7288532240a2d3c5b24e91f528bb018667b0c9f171f8",
      "text": "嚯……天衣无缝之计划！如此一来即便在下一场试炼中，\n想必诸多光之子民亦将被染上暗夜之色。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_02_1_2_029_02:1_2_029_02_d:cmd-000126:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9aae6706f288d1339e99dcbc9e973fed0f016ae824cc81138a86f24988d9ec2e",
      "text": "……啊，不好意思。来电话了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_02_1_2_029_02:1_2_029_02_d:cmd-000131:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cc3960d6c5d40cf69dd79d6ecd220d0310bac4fbe85f6079e011740757c50d0d",
      "text": "好的，辛苦了。我明白了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_02_1_2_029_02:1_2_029_02_d:cmd-000139:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:35a1876f503930fdf56b4bc27aa8991c5652c87096f7bc6ff1c00e42614fbdf6",
      "text": "阿斯兰先生。商量就先到这里，\n我们现在一起去Cafe Parade吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_02_1_2_029_02:1_2_029_02_d:cmd-000145:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e1fe4ae5babd866c9da8538431421eef4a1fce30a76fdb4fe77ec7792ec986ef",
      "text": "前往圣域么……？\n啊啊，吾知晓了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_02_1_2_029_02:1_2_029_02_d:cmd-000165:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fe968d3db8d35ebfe76c2c2d0fde3ba02e8ca36547968532e0b39737cde82bab",
      "text": "来，阿斯兰先生，\n请您先推开门吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_02_1_2_029_02:1_2_029_02_d:cmd-000174:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:95af9bd203811071b2193ec9d4486a42e5f5ebf3fa2f9d81d288cddf9123a018",
      "text": "唔……此举可是主另有深意。\n既为主之所愿……去也！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_02_1_2_029_02:1_2_029_02_d:cmd-000181:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bb4df11f2c6cfc2915200d78744b0459b2793a90316ca8c73cc07951165559ad",
      "text": "……这、这究竟是……！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_02_1_2_029_02:1_2_029_02_e:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ea72727ece30a1d035e1d3ab246ecf8a4daa2c8b7099707ab5553f439dd35bda",
      "text": "阿斯兰，生日快乐！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_02_1_2_029_02:1_2_029_02_e:cmd-000071:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9f955ffb59d5fdad7af1c4408c44a138db60f104705ce2671340d0c2729351f2",
      "text": "这究竟是……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_02_1_2_029_02:1_2_029_02_e:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cc6cc097253fed748223aca5f7858175832075a3eabb402fdd3e5d84076390fe",
      "text": "欢迎来到Cafe Parade。\n今天是为了阿斯兰而包场的哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_02_1_2_029_02:1_2_029_02_e:cmd-000090:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4440829175867aa52bced7d99854d289ea0cda6323bf2867765112755f04a7d4",
      "text": "仅限今夜的特别菜单，\n请尽情享用到心满意足为止吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_02_1_2_029_02:1_2_029_02_e:cmd-000094:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:97eae0f15ab73d670401c2e63e5ac8198a2de26497bb167bf3e4d344a5fee30a",
      "text": "我们还准备了\n特制的生日蛋糕。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_02_1_2_029_02:1_2_029_02_e:cmd-000110:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:780a9518a0951b217ef4a8e7f91c66ee52dc70c2b81ed7dd28e763e2581a515b",
      "text": "吾、主……主难道早已知晓\n此项计划……！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_02_1_2_029_02:1_2_029_02_e:cmd-000116:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:050043f82b2d996068a613b2437e41e4b9108eb1a20ed6625d23540fe15ad4f4",
      "text": "嗯，制作人也帮忙协助了哦！\n因为想让阿斯兰高兴，大家一起想出来的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_02_1_2_029_02:1_2_029_02_e:cmd-000131:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:395e1e0587dd4b9f9651c99d8688715f896c700b3636d0c7194d15a0e800904d",
      "text": "…………",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_02_1_2_029_02:1_2_029_02_e:cmd-000144:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4412da09d3fec84916fd23497988355e22d34efe64b0de847fdd23065804746c",
      "text": "哎、咦？阿斯兰先生，您没事吧！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_02_1_2_029_02:1_2_029_02_e:cmd-000153:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:adb69e809b2735fc12a6729a6b886362950ff79b0c940b626468fe8cf02dae3c",
      "text": "唔……切莫惊慌。不过是过于震撼，\n言语一时遭到了封印罢了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_02_1_2_029_02:1_2_029_02_e:cmd-000168:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4c37ece00365e4515b9eee9ff4e8dbb0923a24ff69e5b951eddda87bc6cfd65c",
      "text": "库库……哈哈哈哈！\n正如主所言，不过是无谓的迷茫罢了……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_029ass_02_1_2_029_02:1_2_029_02_e:cmd-000198:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3510b5baaffe194c4934a70c7f0d392e33927ec0c0b96281130760effa115a9a",
      "text": "同胞们啊！吾感谢汝等之辛劳！\n便与吾同享这永夜之盛宴吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
